Added a new built-in PEAT module for the OpenPLC Runtime v4. This natively integrated module enables discovery, fingerprinting, data collection, and program deployment on OpenPLC v4 instances via its REST API. The implementation features optimized API session caching, respects global HTTPS port configurations, and includes dedicated configuration templates (`examples/openplc-config.yaml`). Additionally, a comprehensive live-testing suite has been included, accessible via the new `--run-container` Pytest flag, which tests the module against a live OpenPLC Docker container.